                                </svg>
                            </span> Takes 2 minutes
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex text-white items-center gap-1 text-14-inter">
                            <span class="text-white"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none"
                                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
